    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1042_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take a pack of dried cactus. Auntie Marco's, por favor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Auntie Marco doesn't put as much additives! It's not as good as Uncle Marco's!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "One pack of dried cactus. I'm starving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You look like you've been up all night. Developing photos?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't help that inspiration likes to strike in the middle of the night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "So when are you gonna have my photo ready?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I remember now... the one you said was a gift? For the girl who's into metal music?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "She dumped me last month...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Memories like to disappear in the middle of the night, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of all the photographers here, I had to pick the one who could never make a deadline.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#7$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back from the Galer\u00eda, Tecno? How was it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get lost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the matter, things didn't go well? Didn't you say last night that you were going to spraypaint the whole place?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What does that palace of his look like on the inside? I heard it's a large collection of works from famous artists. I should have gone with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hardly got a doodle in before I had to run for my life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk, tsk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, you'll get another chance. And bring me along next time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Me too, hehe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough of that, you two... where's the old man?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_001",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1042_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's in a bad mood. Holed himself up in his room all day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess he's waiting for your 'good news'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
