    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "48_g11_deluxeroom_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, just to confirm, you don't know Levi?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Correct. And I should confirm that you don't know my uncle, right? Tall, wears glasses, smiles in the creepiest way you can imagine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say any more and I'll start to wonder if your uncle is the one we're looking for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, I think it's just another unpleasant coincidence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_winglssice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that we've resolved our misunderstandings, would you like a drink?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, thank you, Mr. Reynell. We have to go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you shaking, Iana?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we're not dreaming or hallucinating...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've been 'shot out' by some unknown power through time or space and landed in this place...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "text": "A far-away planet... or Earth in some unimaginable dimension of time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just excited, Ela.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I get it, but we're not just facing a strange world, we have strange problems too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... stay calm, no matter how excited you feel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4125_rdoc_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go, friends. Hopefully, we can find a place to stay before nightfall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doc"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, there's no need for doom and gloom. I'm not ungrateful for you saving my life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "I could at least offer a room with four walls and a roof.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unless you really wanted to sleep on cardboard beneath the sky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_thunders_amb",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4124_iana_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's going to rain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We won't take it for free, Mr. Reynell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "text": "For as long as we accept your hospitality, we will protect you and ensure there won't be any other armed men charging into your room.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Or falling through the roof\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That will do, Mi\u0142osz. She knows what she's doing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) But we don't know anything about them, Reynell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) This is our chance to learn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) You're always so willful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whisper) You know me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're going to turn us down, it would be nice to do it quickly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I have no objections.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get your employment contract drafted before HR leaves for the day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
