        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, I heard you were waiting for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I couldn't do it. But I didn't get hurt either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you watching?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reynell? What is he blabbering about this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#5$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Reynell, as Galer\u00eda Krysztauowa prepares for its grand opening, a local community is also planning an arts festival. What are your thought about it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a lot of respect for art. The people who live there have good ideas and interesting creations, but an arts festival is not something that can be organized by just anybody. They don't have any professional buy-in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is silly to compare the two. The Galer\u00eda has far more significance than their arts festival.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have gathered artwork from across the world in Dossoles, demonstrating the diversity of culture and art, while providing a platform for art lovers everywhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "The importance it poses to the development of art in Dossoles is not something that some amateur arts festival can hope to match.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That peddler called us amateurs?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not the first time we've been at odds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "All those organizations and critics have used our community as a tool to suck up to him on his first day in Dossoles.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "He talks crap about us, using our works as comparison to promote his own garbage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's blocking us at every turn, from exhibitions, disc releases, even small performances.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember his so-called community development project? It was a hot mess and we eventually brought it down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, the hate is mutual\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like you. You went to tag up his Galer\u00eda, didn't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was the one who hired a writer to blast my friend's work in the papers...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, since when has he ever said anything good about us? Let him\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#9$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a couple of words that I want to say on behalf of all Dossoles artists.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#10$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why has Galer\u00eda Krysztauowa drawn so much attention and achieved so much? It's because we represent what is truly of value in the Dossoles art scene.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "Absorbing the cultural nutrients of Dossoles, and representing her true spirit... that is the reason why I built Galer\u00eda Krysztauowa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Who did he say he's representing?! All Dossoles artists?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where was he when we put on a concert for the musicians who escaped the Singas Garden? Where was he when we were translating new Ursus novels?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "What has he ever done for art on Dossoles? How dare he claim to represent Dossoles?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, old man, calm down, calm down...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down?! Do you know he's opening his glass house on the same day as our arts festival?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't believe it when I heard about it this morning, but then he said it on air! It's the same day!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do we do, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Deep breath)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "We do what we want. Who cares about him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's more important to stay focused on taking care of our own. Don't waste your time on him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
