    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "...Capit\u00e1n Mateo.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this everyone who made it back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go on. What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reynell's guards dropped down from the sky and stopped us. We lost a lot of men. I escaped with the survivors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many of them were there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Four.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just four?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Armed with guns. Very well-trained. The way they fought was unusual. We couldn't get through...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Guns... Sankta? No mention of that in the report on Reynell... could it be Blacksteel?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "S-Sir, I will take full responsibility for the failure. Please don't punish anyone else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, you're loyal to your men.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need to be so jittery. That's not a bad thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our intel was insufficient, that's all. Now we know more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take that box on your way out. There's money and casino chips in it. Share it with your men and have some fun at the casino on me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "C-Capit\u00e1n? Are you sure?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep your ears open. Tongues are loose in a place like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir. I'll report if I hear anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about that community? The brass are pushing... It's the last piece of the puzzle for the entertainment district project.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've just got to find a way. If Reynell won't budge, we could start with the community directly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir. I'll pay particular attention to anything about that place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1210_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're my first choice to manage the entertainment district once it's built. Don't disappoint me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mateo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1271_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Commanding Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
