    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "100,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're here earlier than I expected. Again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't like to make people wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry about that. There was a bit of traffic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's nine o'clock on the dot. You're not too late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I used to be punctual, but then I realized that people here like to be fashionably late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No problem. I got time to check out the exhibits.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Galeria's use of light is unique. Natural light during the day, and then bright as day again at night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you like art?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, just a little curious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Feel free to take a look around during your free time. You probably won't get a chance once the Galer\u00eda is officially open.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? No employee tickets?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course there are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I mean is you'll be able to take the time to appreciate a work you like, before the place is with crowds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sometimes it's not the crowd that affects your mood. It's a particularly creepy painting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean the one at the end of the hallway?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not a famous piece. It's a portrait of Reynell's father.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was the one who left behind the legacy that allowed us to build this Galeria, far from home, and collect masterpieces from all across Terra.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why Reynell always felt it was important to do something to commemorate his father.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like putting up a huge portrait here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reynell wants everyone to see his father clearly. Anyway, it's just a portrait. Both Reynell and I believe Mr. Kowalski's merit goes far beyond that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "A faithful son, I see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's almost time. I'll take you to him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
