    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been meaning to ask, why do all visitors have to climb the stairs to get to the penthouse?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "He prefers people expend some kind of effort to come and find him. Everyone has to take at least one flight of stairs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never seen him do it himself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "He has his personal elevator.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's the only one in the Galer\u00eda's office area, and these are the only stairs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds like what a genius would do, alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The silver lining is that it makes security simpler. Anything else I need to know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. You have one job: Keep him alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about at night? Do you need us to rotate shifts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I'll be there at night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
